{
  "id": "REV.11",
  "number": "11",
  "bookId": "REV",
  "reference": "Revelation 11",
  "copyright": "The Holy Bible, New International Version® NIV® Copyright © 1973, 1978, 1984, 2011 by Biblica, Inc.® Used by Permission of Biblica, Inc.® All rights reserved worldwide.",
  "verseCount": 19,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "REV 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The Two Witnesses",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I was given a reed like a measuring rod and was told, \"Go and measure the temple of God and the altar, with its worshipers.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But exclude the outer court; do not measure it, because it has been given to the Gentiles. They will trample on the holy city for 42 months.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will appoint my two witnesses, and they will prophesy for 1,260 days, clothed in sackcloth.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They are \"the two olive trees\" and the two lampstands, and \"they stand before the Lord of the earth.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If anyone tries to harm them, fire comes from their mouths and devours their enemies. This is how anyone who wants to harm them must die.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They have power to shut up the heavens so that it will not rain during the time they are prophesying; and they have power to turn the waters into blood and to strike the earth with every kind of plague as often as they want.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now when they have finished their testimony, the beast that comes up from the Abyss will attack them, and overpower and kill them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Their bodies will lie in the public square of the great city—which is figuratively called Sodom and Egypt—where also their Lord was crucified.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For three and a half days some from every people, tribe, language and nation will gaze on their bodies and refuse them burial.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The inhabitants of the earth will gloat over them and will celebrate by sending each other gifts, because these two prophets had tormented those who live on the earth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But after the three and a half days the breath",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "of life from God entered them, and they stood on their feet, and terror struck those who saw them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then they heard a loud voice from heaven saying to them, \"Come up here.\" And they went up to heaven in a cloud, while their enemies looked on.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At that very hour there was a severe earthquake and a tenth of the city collapsed. Seven thousand people were killed in the earthquake, and the survivors were terrified and gave glory to the God of heaven.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The second woe has passed; the third woe is coming soon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The Seventh Trumpet",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The seventh angel sounded his trumpet, and there were loud voices in heaven, which said:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 11:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"The kingdom of the world has become",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 11:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "the kingdom of our Lord and of his Messiah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 11:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and he will reign for ever and ever.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the twenty-four elders, who were seated on their thrones before God, fell on their faces and worshiped God,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "saying:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 11:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"We give thanks to you, Lord God Almighty,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 11:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "the One who is and who was,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 11:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "because you have taken your great power",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 11:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and have begun to reign.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The nations were angry,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 11:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and your wrath has come.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 11:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The time has come for judging the dead,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 11:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and for rewarding your servants the prophets",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 11:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and your people who revere your name,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 11:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "both great and small—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 11:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and for destroying those who destroy the earth.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then God's temple in heaven was opened, and within his temple was seen the ark of his covenant. And there came flashes of lightning, rumblings, peals of thunder, an earthquake and a severe hailstorm.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "REV.12",
    "number": "12",
    "bookId": "REV"
  },
